### 메시지 목록 조회 (최신 50개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 메시지 목록 조회 (cursor 페이지네이션)
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages?cursor={{messageId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 메시지 전송
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": { "type": "doc", "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "안녕하세요!" }] }] }
}

###

### 메시지 수정 (본인만 가능)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": { "type": "doc", "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "수정된 메시지입니다." }] }] }
}

###

### 메시지 삭제 — 204 예상 (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 스레드 답글 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 스레드 답글 작성
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": { "type": "doc", "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "답글입니다!" }] }] }
}

###

### 답글의 답글 작성 — 400 예상 (1depth 제한)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{replyId}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": { "type": "doc", "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "중첩 답글 시도" }] }] }
}

###

### 리액션 추가 — 204 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "emoji": "👍"
}

###

### 리액션 중복 추가 — 204 예상 (upsert라 중복 무시)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "emoji": "👍"
}

###

### 리액션 삭제 — 204 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reactions/👍
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 없는 리액션 삭제 — 404 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reactions/❌
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 읽음 마커 업데이트 (upsert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/read-markers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "lastReadMessageId": "{{messageId}}"
}

###
